{
  "id": "1CO.9",
  "number": "9",
  "bookId": "1CO",
  "reference": "1 Bakolinto 9",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ūyo īng'wigeleelilwe ntūng'wa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī ū nene natī ntungūlwa? Nūūlū natī ntūng'wa? Ū nene natamonile ū Yesu Seeba wise? A bing'we mutī nīmo gwane ū mulī Seeba? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū nakabiza natī ntūng'wa ū kū bangī, alīyo ū kū bing'we h'ūmo nalī, nguno a bing'we mulī lūmeng'ho lwa nīmo gwa būtūng'wa bone ū mulī Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lyenīlī h'ī lishosho lyane ū kū banhū abo bakūnibūgīlījaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angū, a bise tūtī nabo ū būdūla bo kūlya na kūng'wa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūtadūgije kūtoola nkīma nzunya wa kūja nang'hwe būlī kwene, gīt'ūmo bakwītīlaga a batūng'wa a bangī, na a bazunaye ba ng'wa Seeba, pyī nū Kefa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū hamo nalī nene na Balinaba dūhū abo tūtī nabo ū būdūla bo kūleka kūtūmama? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī nshilikale kī ūyo akilishaga wei ng'wenekīlī ikanza lyose lyose? Nūūlū munhū kī ūyo akahambaga nzabibu alīyo ūleka ū kūlya a matwajo gago? Na hangī nani ūyo akadīīmaga mitugo alīyo a mabeele yaya ū kūgang'wa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū hamo ī yenīyī nalihayīla nene dūhū kūlwa būmunhū bone? Tūhaya nī shilagīlo h'ūmo shihayīlile? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū mu shilagīlo sha ng'wa Musa handīkilwe gīkī, “Ū ng'ombe ūlū īlītūmama nīmo gwa kūtūla",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kūtūla:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, kūpandagīla; (lol. Ksh 25:4; 1Ti 5:18).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " būsīga, yaya ū kwītunga ū kū nomo gwayo.” Hū kūhaya ū Mulungu akūdīlīlaga mihayo ya ng'ombe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nūūlū alīhaya kūlwa nguno yise? Ūlī kūlwa nguno yise, īkī ū nīmi shing'wigeleelilwe alīme mu kwisagīlwa kwa kūpandīka matwajo; pyī nū ntūji wa būsīga nang'hwe gīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bise ūlū tūkahamba shikolo sha Kiimoyo ū mu bing'we, gūlīkūla no ū gwa kūpandīka shikolo sha mīlī ū kūfuma ū kū bing'we? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū īlīdūlīkana a bangī kūpandīka ngabo ū kūfuma ū kū bing'we, nibūlī a bise tūtizūpandīka na kūtinda ho? Gwike dūhū ū būdūla wenūbo tūtabūtūmamīlile, tūkwiyūmīlījaga mu mihayo yose, gīkī tūtizūntūūlīla munhū ose ose mhayo gwa kūng'wipamya ū kū Ng'hūlū Jawiza ja ng'wa Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutamanile gīkī abo bakatūmamaga mu hekalu bakalyaga sha mu hekalu? Nī gīkī abo bakatūmamaga ha ng'walīlo nabo bakapandīkīlaga ha ng'walīlo henaho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo ahelelile ū Seeba nū kū balomeeji ba Ng'hūlū Jawiza, gīkī nabo bayūpandīkīla ng'wenūmo ī shiigunaanīlo sha mu būpanga wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū nene nataalī ū kwītūmamīla nūūlū kamò ī mihayo yenīyo. Hama nī yenīyī natūyandīkaga gīkī ng'wandye kūnīītīla ī mihayo yenīyo, nguno īlī hambū hambū ū nene nache kūtinda munhū ose ose kūgūkenaagūla ū mhayo ūyo nagūyegelile gwenūyū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene natī na gwa kwikumīlīgīja ū mu nīmo gwa kūjilomeela ī Ng'hūlū Jawiza; nguno nahadīkilwe. Ūlū nūleka ū kūjilomeela ī Ng'hūlū Jawiza nakūgwīlwa makoye ū nene ng'wenekīlī! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūlū nūjilomeela kūlwa kūtogwa nene ng'wenekīlī numho nalī na mheela, alīyo ūlū ītī kūlwa būtogwa bone, numho hū kūhaya nabilisīlilwe sabo ya bangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū ī mheela yane īlī kī? Īlī gīkī, ū mu kūjilomeela ī Ng'hūlū Jawiza najifunye dalali, natizūtūmama mu kwisagīlwa kwanukūla shikolo īsho nigeleelilwe kūshanukūla kūlwago ū nīmo gwa kūjilomeela ī Ng'hūlū Jawiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene ng'hana ī chene nalī mu wiyabī kū banhū bose ūmo bagelelile, alīyo nitūūla ha sīlīlī ya būsese wa banhū bose, gīkī nabapandīke banhū bingī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū Bayudaya nalī gītī Nyudaya, gīkī nabapandīke a Bayudaya. Ū kū banhū abo balī ha sīlīlī ya shilagīlo, nakūbizaga gītī nalī ha sīlīlī ya shilagīlo, gīkī nabapandīke abo basugilwe na shilagīlo; (nūūlū īkī ū nene ng'wenekīlī natasugilwe na shilagīlo). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū kū banhū abo batī na shilagīlo, nakūbizaga gītī natī na shilagīlo, gīkī nabapandīke abo batī na shilagīlo, (alīyo h'ītī gīkī natī na shilagīlo ū kūlī Mulungu, ū nene ng'wenekīlī nalī ha sīlīlī ya shilagīlo sha ng'wa Kilisito). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū bagokolo nakūbizaga ngokolo, gīkī nabapandīke a bagokolo; nakūbizaga mu mbika jose kū banhū bose, gīkī bamò na bamò nabapandīke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pyī ī yose yenīyī nakwīyītaga kūlwa nguno ya Ng'hūlū Jawiza, gīkī nane nabize na būsangī ū mu nīmo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī mutamanile gīkī abo bakapeelaga mu wishiganhīlwa bakapeelaga pye a bose, alīyo ūyo akapandīkaga mheela akabizaga ūmò dūhū? Na a bing'we peelagi gīko mupandīke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama hangī būlī munhū ūyo alī mu tagambī ya wishiganhīji akilang'hanaga mu yose. A bene bakīītaga gīko kūlwa kwanukūla ngikili īyo īdūgije kūkenaagūka; alīyo a bise ītī ya kūkenaagūka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū nene nakūpeelaga gīko, gwike h'ītī gīkī natamanile īsho nakwītaga; nakūlwaga bo ngumī, alīyo h'ītī gīkī nakūtūlaga lūyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūgūluhyaga ū mīlī gwane, nakūgūtūūlaga mu būsese ītizūbiza gīkī, ūlū namala ū kūbalomeela a bangī, ū nene ng'wenekīlī nabize o kūleng'wa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
